---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Anirudh Bompada"
  description="How this personal website uses privacy-conscious, cookie-free analytics."
>
  <section class="privacy-page" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <header class="privacy-header">
      <h1 id="privacy-title">Privacy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: November 7, 2026</p>
      <p class="privacy-intro">
        This personal website uses Umami Cloud to understand site traffic
        and improve its content without personalized advertising.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose privacy-content">
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="https://umami.is/">Umami Cloud</a> measures pageviews, visits,
        referring websites, approximate visitor location (such as country),
        and basic browser and device details. It does not use analytics cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>How information is handled</h2>
      <p>
        Umami processes IP addresses and browser information to estimate visits
        and approximate locations. Raw IP addresses are not stored as standard
        analytics fields, though Umami and its infrastructure providers may
        retain operational or security logs. URL query parameters and fragments
        are excluded from this site's analytics.
      </p>
      <p>
        The website is hosted on GitHub Pages, which processes network requests
        to deliver its pages. No visitor account or personal contact details
        are required to browse the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Analytics is configured to honor browser Do Not Track preferences where
        supported. Privacy extensions may also block tracking. The website
        remains usable with analytics blocked.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        The current Umami Cloud Hobby plan provides six months of analytics
        history; operational logs and backups may have different retention.
        For details about the provider, see the
        <a href="https://umami.is/privacy">Umami Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) 0 6rem;
  }

  .privacy-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .privacy-page h1 {
    max-width: none;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.7rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .privacy-updated {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .privacy-intro {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: #c3d0d6;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
  }

  .privacy-content h2 {
    margin: 2rem 0 0.7rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.4vw, 1.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .privacy-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .privacy-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .privacy-page {
      padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
